{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6ebee7cedd15f80a","name":"Master of Teräs Käsi Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-6ebee7cedd15f80a","title":"Master of Teräs Käsi Talent Tree","revision":26645,"timestamp":"2025-04-09T23:58:17Z","sha256":"6bf77f878086816454e0c0b693cdfd433b6253b063ad0c73bd2989ae7c58228f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26645","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Master%20of%20Ter%C3%A4s%20K%C3%A4si%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6ebee7cedd15f80a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Teräs Käsi is a powerful and deadly martial arts form that enables its wielder to deal devastating amounts of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," damage.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Teräs Käsi Basics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_I","referenceId":"reference:e2ebb2bef3706adf"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You deal an additional die of damage with your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Ignore Damage Reduction"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Teräs Käsi Basics"]},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_I","referenceId":"reference:e2ebb2bef3706adf"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"}," against a target that has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},", and you deal more damage than the target's DR, you ignore the target's DR completely.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Teräs Käsi Mastery"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Teräs Käsi Basics"]},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_I","referenceId":"reference:e2ebb2bef3706adf"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts II"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_II","referenceId":"reference:7a2046d81777b063"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts III"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_III","referenceId":"reference:8355a8207a800c91"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you make only ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c"}," during a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"}," Action, you can take the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"}," Action as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", instead of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," Can a character who has the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Teräs Käsi Mastery"]}," Talent and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"}," Feat combine these with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mighty Swing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mighty_Swing","referenceId":"reference:9f931d147940b545"}," Feat? Specifically, could I use two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," to get the benefit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mighty Swing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mighty_Swing","referenceId":"reference:9f931d147940b545"}," and then use my ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," to make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"},"? If so, would the extra die of damage from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mighty Swing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mighty_Swing","referenceId":"reference:9f931d147940b545"}," apply to both attacks from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"}," or only to the first attack?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," Yes, you can use ",{"tag":"b","children":["Teräs Käsi Mastery"]},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mighty Swing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mighty_Swing","referenceId":"reference:9f931d147940b545"}," at the same time, using two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mighty Swing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mighty_Swing","referenceId":"reference:9f931d147940b545"}," and then your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," for an unarmed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["However, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mighty Swing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mighty_Swing","referenceId":"reference:9f931d147940b545"}," specifies that its extra damage applies only to your ",{"tag":"i","children":["next"]}," attack in the same round, so the second attack from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"}," (or any other source of extra attacks) would not gain this benefit.\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Unarmed Counterstrike"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Teräs Käsi Basics"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Unarmed Parry"]},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_I","referenceId":"reference:e2ebb2bef3706adf"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts II"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_II","referenceId":"reference:7a2046d81777b063"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you successfully parry a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," with the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Unarmed Parry"]}," Talent, you can immediately make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," against that target.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Unarmed Parry"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Teräs Käsi Basics"]},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_I","referenceId":"reference:e2ebb2bef3706adf"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts II"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_II","referenceId":"reference:7a2046d81777b063"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fight Defensively"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fight_Defensively","referenceId":"reference:ce11520546392760"},", as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," you can negate a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," by making a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," attack roll. If your attack roll equals or exceeds the attack roll of the incoming ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"},", the attack is negated. You must be aware of the attack, and not be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},", and you take a cumulative -2 penalty to all attack rolls for each attack roll made since the beginning of your last turn.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
